  "problem": "The broker predicts that, in the future, the stock will have an overall behavior similar to the function $\\sqrt[3]{5x-10}.$ Calculate ${lim}_{x\\to \\infty }\\sqrt[3]{5x-10}.$\n\n                            \n                                    \n                                        \n                                            \n\n                                                \n\n                                        \n                                        \n                                        \n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        ${lim}_{x\\to \\infty }\\sqrt[3]{5x-10}=$\n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                            \n                                        {{field-1}}",
